00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:38.400
So we've appealed this to Twitch multiple times&nbsp;
on different grounds. We've not heard back.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:42.400
I don't know whether that's likely to go anywhere,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:46.960
but this really isn't good now. I do want to&nbsp;
address there are people writing in and saying,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:51.200
David, you've been arguing in favor of platforms&nbsp;
being allowed to do this. These are their terms&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:55.280
of service and they're enforcing them.&nbsp;
